  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'FOUR TRUCKS. ONE RIDICULOUS SYMPHONY.


    Each participant owns a different
    instrumental part: grand piano, drums and cymbals, brass horns, or xylophone
    and bells. Use your assigned LEFT / DOWN / UP / RIGHT rhythm lanes. Complete
    simultaneous notes together and hold long notes to their tails. Successful note
    heads sound immediately; held notes score only when completed. Misses produce
    a quiet comic wrong note.


    The conductor, moving keys, mallets, bells and
    trumpets follow the same music clock. PERFECT / GREAT / GOOD timing and calibrated
    keyboard/controller input use the established Dance-Off engine. Use CALIBRATE
    in setup if your display or audio is delayed. Your instrument contributes its
    own real notes to the arrangement.


    Choose ENSEMBLE for one combined performance
    or COMPETITIVE for individual timing scores. Choose one song or a three-song
    concert, seven original arrangements and four chart difficulties. AI uses the
    same timed note and hold rules with difficulty-dependent errors. Pause and reconnect
    preserve the music position and use a resume count-in. Horn remains available
    through the shared controls. All scores lock before the finale; rematch resets
    every instrument.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
